cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Firebrand3D viewer
message: >-
  If you use this software or the dataset it presents, please cite the data
  descriptor once it is published.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ha-Ninh
    family-names: Nguyen
    affiliation: >-
      FLARE Wildfire Research, School of Ecosystem and Forest Sciences,
      The University of Melbourne
repository-code: https://github.com/NinhGhoster/firebrand3D-viewer
url: https://firebrand3d.flarewildfire.app/
abstract: >-
  A browser viewer for the Firebrand3D characterisation dataset: 7,663
  firebrands reconstructed in three dimensions from 372 controlled burning
  experiments, paired with the RGB and thermal recordings of the
  burns that produced them. Firebrands are browsed by fuel family with facets
  that follow the family, each experiment's recordings are playable including
  continuation segments, and every firebrand's mesh can be inspected in 3D
  alongside its measured volume, surface area, volume-to-surface-area ratio,
  bounding dimensions, mass and density.
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - bushfire
  - firebrand
  - spotting
  - fire science
  - research data
  - 3D morphology
license: GPL-3.0
